Sandbox: deep dive — Policy + sandbox together

```ts

const codeExecution = sandboxTool({ apiKey: process.env.E2B_API_KEY! })

const mandatory = createMandatorySandbox({
  sandbox: codeExecution,
  policy: {
    allow: ['code_execution'],
