Rate limiting — Per-tier buckets

```ts
const limiter = createRateLimiter ({
  keyOf: ctx => ctx.userId,
  bucketOf: ctx => ctx.tier,
  buckets: {
    free: { capacity: 10,   refill: 10,   windowMs: 60_000 },
    pro:  { capacity: 1000, refill: 1000, windowMs: 60_000 },
  },
})
