Self-debug tool — Custom debuggers

You don't have to use an LLM — any heuristic works:

```ts
const pinnedRetry = wrapToolWithSelfDebug(tool, ({ error, args }) => {
  if (/unknown field "limit"/.test(error.message)) {
    const { limit: _, ...rest } = args
    return { args: rest }
  }
  return { args: null }
})
